values ('d4e5f6a7-8b9c-4e98-9b78-8f9a0b1c2d88', 'liberal-arts-humanities-distribution', 'Liberal Arts / Humanities Distribution', 'This course introduces students to the liberal arts and humanities as disciplined ways of interpreting texts, images, places, performances, beliefs, histories, and cultural practices. It is especially useful for architecture and design-adjacent students because it connects visual/spatial literacy with writing, ethical reasoning, historical context, social analysis, and global cultural awareness.');

